OL,3,GNEWSADreams on hold: The 'frustrating'
OL,4,Aeducation limbo facing teenage asylum
OL,5,Aseekers
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn war-torn Gaza, 16-year-old Mona was
OL,8,Fable to receive more education than she
OL,9,Fsays she's currently able to get in
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,12,FThat is because, as a refugee or asylum
OL,13,Fseeker aged 16, she is not
OL,14,Fautomatically able to enter school or
OL,15,Fcollege in Northern Ireland.
OL,17,FAt present, the legal age until which
OL,18,Feducation is compulsory is 16.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
